Streaming correctness with end-to-end guarantees is critical for real-time features at scale; tests must cover late data, fault tolerance, and observability across the pipeline.

## Key Concepts
- Exactly-once semantics
- Checkpointing and sinks
- Fault injection and chaos engineering
- Data generation for late events
- Observability with traces and metrics

